[{"client_msg_id":"4ad72d05-6e5f-4327-ad5d-85f705f2c65c","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://gigazine.net/news/20210623-matsuya-pork-steak-koumi-shoyu/\u003e","ts":"1624459344.446200","attachments":[{"fallback":"GIGAZINE: ガッツリにんにく味の厚切り豚肉にアーモンドがさくさくの「香味醤油ダレ」を絡めた松屋「ポークステーキ丼」試食レビュー","id":1,"title":"ガッツリにんにく味の厚切り豚肉にアーモンドがさくさくの「香味醤油ダレ」を絡めた松屋「ポークステーキ丼」試食レビュー","title_link":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210623-matsuya-pork-steak-koumi-shoyu/","text":"厚切りの豚肉に香味醤油ダレを絡めた「ポークステーキ丼(香味醤油)」が2021年6月22日(火)から松屋に登場しています。ポークステーキ丼は松屋が得意とする「ガツンとにんにく風味」をベースに、さくさくアーモンドの香味醤油だれがかけられ、酸味のきいたシャキシャキ野菜のエスカベッシュが添えられているという品。お肉が2倍の「ダブル」も同日から登場したとのことなので、「ポークステーキ丼(香味醤油)」「ポークステーキ丼ダブル(香味醤油)」の2つをテイクアウトで購入して食べてみました。","image_url":"https://i.gzn.jp/img/2021/06/23/matsuya-pork-steak-koumi-shoyu/00.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"GIGAZINE","service_icon":"https://gigazine.net/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210623-matsuya-pork-steak-koumi-shoyu/","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210623-matsuya-pork-steak-koumi-shoyu/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0rfYi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57a29290-aff0-43ae-a28a-3c9ea53dab5e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"結構近いかも。ちなみに中身は非加熱です","ts":"1624416866.445500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gA7cB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a649f3d0-5a6b-42c6-b7e3-f2f856c244a3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"海苔天、思い出す。スナックのしか食べたことないけど。","ts":"1624415306.444700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Lgd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf6b825-38fa-410f-a7b1-80bd9d954f3a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ウニの天麩羅はノリで挟んで揚げるそうだけど、それ感","ts":"1624415049.443900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qUVH3"}]},{"client_ms